                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "21f885d0-f471-448e-bb4e-7e83cbd2fde5",
                        "entry_id": "68feafaf-c382-3a05-ad50-f7cc72866ed3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "onvolkomenheden"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4b6521f4-5e65-3112-a517-fdf3abbd163e",
                        "entry_id": "68feafaf-c382-3a05-ad50-f7cc72866ed3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een klein foutje dat ervoor zorgt dat iets niet helemaal perfect is"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a781352-37db-4c64-8d0b-d45bb10dfd14",
                                "sense_id": "4b6521f4-5e65-3112-a517-fdf3abbd163e",
                                "text": "Eén foutje doorkruiste zaterdag de EK-kwalificatie van Petra Witjes. Een val op het onderdeel vloer betekende 0,8 punt aftrek. De technische onvolkomenheid daarbij opgeteld maakte er een vol strafpunt van. En dan te bedenken dat de zestienjarige turnster uit Oldenzaal maar 0,2 punt te kort kwam aan het einde van de rit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "def7b418-1505-4667-87a0-f3cb8db98c0b",
                                "sense_id": "4b6521f4-5e65-3112-a517-fdf3abbd163e",
                                "text": "De voorstelling duurde net even te lang en dat had niets te maken met een kleine technische onvolkomenheid of met een paar regendruppels."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df5b8265-58e7-478b-aa79-469596a4b88f",
                                "sense_id": "4b6521f4-5e65-3112-a517-fdf3abbd163e",
                                "text": "Oorzaak vormt een fout in het drukproces, waardoor bij de adresssering eventuele toevoegingen bij het huisnummer (voorbeeld: 52 a) ontbreken. Volgens een woordvoerder van de gemeente Enschede heeft Post NL de onvolkomenheid inmiddels erkend."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6745c215-3841-438e-b327-25e0588029a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "68feafaf-c382-3a05-ad50-f7cc72866ed3",
                        "source_sense_id": "4b6521f4-5e65-3112-a517-fdf3abbd163e",
                        "target_lang_word": "deficiency",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deficiency",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d786e1c-9295-3ad6-9601-56a38c90b251",
                                        "entry_id": "1a386003-b5a6-38c7-a5b5-342d5a857511",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inadequacy or incompleteness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3694b773-3087-4635-ad0e-3c6600027c00",
                                                "sense_id": "2d786e1c-9295-3ad6-9601-56a38c90b251",
                                                "text": "The face which emerged was not reassuring.[…]. He was not a mongol but there was a deficiency of a sort there, and it was not made more pretty by a latter-day hair cut which involved eccentrically long elf-locks and oiled black curls."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4746c8d0-797e-3fd5-b6d7-cec541d03a6e",
                                        "entry_id": "1a386003-b5a6-38c7-a5b5-342d5a857511",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An insufficiency, especially of something essential to health."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a285176-0693-46d4-b55d-4dfafdff73b7",
                                                "sense_id": "4746c8d0-797e-3fd5-b6d7-cec541d03a6e",
                                                "text": "One of academia’s deficiencies is that, though its lecture halls and graduate schools are replete with women, its higher echelons are not. Often, this is seen as a phenomenon specific to the sciences. … In fact, the disparity applies to the whole grove. Another report from 2006, by the American Association of University Professors, found the same ratio in the faculties of arts, humanities and social science, too."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78e9511a-ec55-3b28-a24f-60077a234816",
                                        "entry_id": "1a386003-b5a6-38c7-a5b5-342d5a857511",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The amount by which the number of double points on a curve is short of the maximum for curves of the same degree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e3ada3f-4ea8-38f4-a480-9adf46095e69",
                                        "entry_id": "1a386003-b5a6-38c7-a5b5-342d5a857511",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The codimension of a linear system in the corresponding complete linear system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c0b8daa4-0307-4564-91c9-5d6cc2598595",
                        "source_entry_id": "68feafaf-c382-3a05-ad50-f7cc72866ed3",
                        "source_sense_id": "4b6521f4-5e65-3112-a517-fdf3abbd163e",
                        "target_lang_word": "imperfection",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imperfection",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43f2ad4b-864b-39a0-a708-02d214067359",
                                        "entry_id": "ef043c0f-2aee-3e3b-8664-3498c680e98f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Those qualities or features that are imperfect; the characteristic, state, or quality of being imperfect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e867e530-d857-4eb2-9af6-db71c6f7822f",
                                                "sense_id": "43f2ad4b-864b-39a0-a708-02d214067359",
                                                "text": "You can accept your imperfection or try to improve."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eed1b654-599c-4284-b66c-4114162ee3dc",
                                                "sense_id": "43f2ad4b-864b-39a0-a708-02d214067359",
                                                "text": "And for the first time she realised what it was to escape from the smallish perfection of England, into the grander imperfection of a great continent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2ce7f87-97b5-35b3-b30d-656f97a8c823",
                                        "entry_id": "ef043c0f-2aee-3e3b-8664-3498c680e98f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that makes something else less than perfect; a blemish, impurity, error, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6601c29c-5216-49a2-a0a1-5b146aa643e7",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ce7f87-97b5-35b3-b30d-656f97a8c823",
                                                "text": "He loves me despite my imperfections."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e32b127e-195b-42a4-82c6-fd1bdf1a0b94",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ce7f87-97b5-35b3-b30d-656f97a8c823",
                                                "text": "It will be sufficient for me if I discover many beauties or imperfections which others have not attended to; and I should be very glad to see one of our eminent writers publish their discoveries on the same subject."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "997cc9e9-678c-4dda-97c6-0b62d8933e62",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ce7f87-97b5-35b3-b30d-656f97a8c823",
                                                "text": "Notice that cleavage has nothing to do with imperfections in the crystal. Indeed, if you try cleaving an imperfect crystal, you may find that it cannot be cleaved as well as a perfect one. The cleavage is the result of the orderliness of the atomic arrangement. No wonder imperfections, which disturb the orderliness, disturb the cleavage as well. You will also note that the cleavage directions are obedient to the symmetry of the crystal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
